<title>SPAIN: Buba's Issing - no reason for German rate cut now.</title>
<headline>Buba's Issing - no reason for German rate cut now.</headline>
<dateline>PAMPLONA, Spain 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank board member Otmar Issing said on Thursday that there was no reason for an interest rate cut in Germany at the moment.</p>
<p>&quot;I expressed my opinion just a few weeks ago, and I haven't changed my mind. There is no reason for a rate cut in Germany,&quot; Issing told bankers in Pamplona.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
